/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Build artifacts that land HERE rather than in output-dir. Only
# IPBES_Fact_Checker.qmd is affected: it is excluded from _quarto.yml's
# `render:` list so it runs after the rest, and Quarto applies a project's
# output-dir only to files it renders as part of the project. Rendering it
# singly therefore picks up the project's `format:` but NOT its `output-dir`.
# build_report_output_dir() copies the result into output/reports/; these are
# the originals targets tracks, not something to commit.
/IPBES_Fact_Checker.html
/IPBES_Fact_Checker_files/
